H.us.pbe.z_1.ld1.psl.v1.0.0-high-full-waves.upf

Scalar H USPP with one valence electron, PBE and PSLibrary 1.0.0 high settings.
This fixture supplements the original SSSP v2.0 PBE Precision H potential
with original per-projector all-electron and pseudo partial waves.
It is an explicitly supplemented dataset, not an unchanged SSSP release file.

Original SSSP filename
H.us.pbe.z_1.ld1.psl.v1.0.0-high.upf
Original SHA-256
4bfc6c7f5321b7d6a75c55a59abdfc82c779744ef376e9103ca2258456eb44e1
Supplemented SHA-256
788c20443f21cd4fcd5504886db606e25462c650a79128099af9392b006acb6b

The original potential, projectors, overlap augmentation, radial mesh and
quadrature data match the original-generator replay. The original numerical
arrays are retained. Only the full-wave block and its header flag are added
using tools/pseudopotentials/add_upf_full_waves.py. The embedded generator
input and original author information remain in PP_INFO.

The original SSSP collection source is recorded in data/SSSP/2.0/SOURCE.
The wave-producing Quantum ESPRESSO qe-6.3 UPF has SHA-256
56deb5401f6463b3b428be5661b4ba6b47b84643a17475870c725899f60f01f2.
Replay the embedded input with lsave_wfc=.true. in &inputp. The generator
source is https://github.com/QEF/q-e/releases/tag/qe-6.3.

